<view class="ob-wrap">
  <view class="ob-logo">👓</view>
  <view class="ob-title">欢迎加入找眼镜助手 🎉</view>
  <view class="ob-sub">先了解一下：你手上有这些硬件设备吗？（可多选）</view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="device-opt {{picks.uhf_reader ? 'on' : ''}}" data-key="uhf_reader" bindtap="togglePick">
      <view class="opt-ico">📡</view>
      <view class="opt-main">
        <view class="opt-name">UHF 手持机（RFID 读取器）</view>
        <view class="opt-desc">配合贴在眼镜上的无源电子标签，拿手持机扫房间找眼镜</view>
      </view>
      <view class="opt-check">{{picks.uhf_reader ? '✓' : ''}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="device-opt {{picks.case_locator ? 'on' : ''}}" data-key="case_locator" bindtap="togglePick">
      <view class="opt-ico">🎒</view>
      <view class="opt-main">
        <view class="opt-name">眼镜盒定位器</view>
        <view class="opt-desc">装在眼镜盒上，找"盒子+眼镜"一起丢的情况，可远程蜂鸣</view>
      </view>
      <view class="opt-check">{{picks.case_locator ? '✓' : ''}}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="ob-note">都没有也没关系：问答式推理不依赖任何硬件，选"有"可让设备信号辅助定位。之后也能在画像页修改。</view>

    <view class="btn-row">
      <button class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="skip" disabled="{{busy}}">都没有，跳过</button>
      <button class="btn btn-main" bindtap="confirm" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">开始使用</button>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
